  "baked": "2026-11-13",
  "mm_per_level_receipt": "24 mm over the full 16-bit range, 65535 = tallest = face 0 mm. Library 092 has no heightmap role; this is the 2026-11-07 web heightmap (1200 x 1200 px = 2 px/mm, 0..65535) the website's tray bake uses. Checked 2026-11-13 against Library 092 stl.stl (600 x 600 x 34 mm = 24 relief + 10 base): STL top height vs heightmap level correlates +0.973 as-is (flipped up-down +0.82, left-right +0.80), slope 3.79e-4 mm/level = 24.8 mm over the full range; manifest relief_mm 24. The pleat lips' undercut is not in a height field (the site says so too).",
